---
description: Content & TinaCMS rules
globs: src/content/**,src/data/**,src/content.config.ts,tina/**
---

- This area is CMS-owned (owner edits live via TinaCMS → commits to `main`).
  `git fetch` + rebase before editing; prefer code changes to content edits.
- Frontmatter must satisfy the Zod schema in `src/content.config.ts`.
- Any `tina/config.ts` change requires regenerating + verifying `tina/tina-lock.json`,
  kept in sync with `src/content.config.ts`, or the live `/admin` breaks.
- A Tina `reference` list to the same collection breaks codegen — use a slug string list.
- No secrets in content/data files.
